6,"Forak Language (FRQ) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ... - Ethnologue",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/frq/,"Forak is an endangered indigenous language of Papua New Guinea. It belongs to the Trans-New Guinea language family. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Forak,Trans-New Guinea
