8,Music of Melanesia — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/music_of_melanesia,"The music of Melanesia encompasses the diverse traditional and contemporary musical practices of the indigenous peoples across the island chains of Papua New Guinea, the Solomon Islands, Vanuatu, Fiji, and New Caledonia, regions marked by over 1,100 languages and profound cultural variation. [1] [2] Rooted in kin-based reciprocity and social reproduction, it features intricate vocal styles ...",Forak,Trans-New Guinea
